{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CeseCHSB2CR3eKaQM92X6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. **Added error code** (ApiError.kt)\nAdded `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED` to the ErrorCode enum to handle the case when trying to confirm a cancelled shipment.\n\n### 2. **Implemented confirm endpoint** (ShipmentController.kt)\nAdded `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` that:\n- Returns **404** if the shipment doesn't exist\n- Returns **409** if the shipment is CANCELLED\n- Transitions CREATED → CONFIRMED and persists the change\n- Returns the shipment unchanged if already CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n- Returns the shipment as the response body\n\n### 3. **Added comprehensive tests** (ShipmentControllerTest.kt)\nAdded 4 test cases covering:\n- ✅ Confirming a created shipment transitions it to confirmed\n- ✅ Confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing (idempotency)\n- ✅ Rejecting confirmation of a cancelled shipment with 409 conflict\n- ✅ Rejecting confirmation of non-existent shipment with 404 not found\n\n## Verification\n- **All 17 tests pass** (5 existing + 4 new shipment tests + 8 other tests)\n- **No new dependencies** added\n- **No unrelated files modified** \n- **Existing architecture preserved** - follows the same Spring Boot + Kotlin patterns"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1938,"cache_read_input_tokens":42046,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1938},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98565fc8-a452-4bb0-b2f5-9ad62bb4f5a5","uuid":"9ad7d72f-a649-4baf-a54b-becea84343a8","t